              "type": "verse",
              "number": "2",
              "lines": [
                "Manabii wa bal iwa kalia kwa mungu wao \"asubui adi hazuuri mungu wao amelala \"2x Elia kawaziaki mungu wao amelala ."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "comment",
