              "type": "verse",
              "number": "3",
              "lines": [
                "Elia akalia ewe mungu wa mababu jeho va ndio jina lako shusha moto toka mbingu uteketeze mazabahu jina lako lituku zwe."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "comment",
